WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:18,070
I know that I'm supposed to, that I'm not supposed to be eating dairy, but can I have a pizza once in a while?

00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:28,070
So, remember that your diet is a diet. It's not a religion. So, can you cheat on your diet once in a while? Yes, you can.

00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:44,070
I think that your body can handle it once in a while. So, yes, don't be so hard on yourself that you take every joy out of your life either.

00:00:44,070 --> 00:01:03,070
So, just keep that in mind. It's a diet to help your body heal. The more healthy you get, the more, you know, often you can cheat and feel good about it and feel like you're still able to bounce back and get back on track.

